7","ordinal":365291,"en":"A multitude filling the land;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l008","ordinal":365292,"en":"At the sight, the mind reeled,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l009","ordinal":365293,"en":"And splendid Sarybai"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l010","ordinal":365294,"en":"Towered like a green poplar."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l011","ordinal":365295,"en":"That infidel Sarybai—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l012","ordinal":365296,"en":"Throughout the whole wide world,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l013","ordinal":365297,"en":"That shield-wielding warrior—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l014","ordinal":365298,"en":"See his brows like a crouching hound,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l015","ordinal":365299,"en":"See his head as large as a cauldron,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l016","ordinal":365300,"en":"His beard like a quiver case,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l017","ordinal":365301,"en":"The breath issuing from his mouth"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l018","ordinal":365302,"en":"Like flame from a bellows."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l019","ordinal":365303,"en":"Ask no more of that wretch;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l020","ordinal":365304,"en":"Behold what he looked like:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l021","ordinal":365305,"en":"His nose like a jagged ice ridge,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l022","ordinal":365306,"en":"As though he would devour the world."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l023","ordinal":365307,"en":"A fierce and venomous man,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l024","ordinal":365308,"en":"Whose menace made men panic,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l025","ordinal":365309,"en":"As though he would slaughter the whole world"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l026","ordinal":365310,"en":"And stride on, licking it clean."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l027","ordinal":365311,"en":"Such was the bloodthirsty tyrant."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l028","ordinal":365312,"en":"He thundered before his army;"}]
